[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11281.19, "timestamp": "03:08:01", "text": "达。呃，总之，我得离开这里了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11283.51, "timestamp": "03:08:03", "text": "不，没关系。是的，请随意留下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11285.75, "timestamp": "03:08:05", "text": "或者，如果你愿意的话，可以看看。我去睡觉了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11286.83, "timestamp": "03:08:06", "text": "是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11289.91, "timestamp": "03:08:09", "text": "是的。不过，谢谢你的光临。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11292.349, "timestamp": "03:08:12", "text": "我非常感谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11297.309, "timestamp": "03:08:17", "text": "D 真的意义非凡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11301.389, "timestamp": "03:08:21", "text": "嗯。我也上床睡觉了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11304.15, "timestamp": "03:08:24", "text": "猜测。今天我做了很多事，虽然只做了一小部分。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11316.03, "timestamp": "03:08:36", "text": "床。今天是第64天，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11319.429, "timestamp": "03:08:39", "text": "是的。不，我来写摘要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11323.83, "timestamp": "03:08:43", "text": "明天在推特上。我去睡觉了。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11326.99, "timestamp": "03:08:46", "text": "3:00。我今天过得很漫长。"}]